Pay_Concrete_Test
├── when the amount is zero
│   └── it should do nothing
└── when the amount is not zero
    ├── when less than the minimum payout gas is left
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when at least the minimum payout gas is left
        ├── when the transfer succeeds
        │   └── it should pay the recipient
        └── when the transfer fails
            ├── when the transfer ran out of gas
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the token refused it
                ├── it should add the amount to the recipient's claimable balance
                ├── it should add it to the total claimable
                └── it should emit {PayoutDeferred}
